      <rules>
        <rule id="13121bee-a9f6-5831-be26-5e09eb21c3aa" name="Burrow" hidden="false">
          <description>This model may go back into Reserves at the end of your Movement Phase if it did not arrive from Reserves this Turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fbc00f26-540c-5578-9f2f-f35204dea077" name="Terror from the Deep" hidden="false">
          <description>This model uses its Emergence Hole weapon when it arrives from Deepstrike. Place the 5” Blast instead of this model when arriving and resolve all Scatters and Hits per normal. Push all non-Titanic models out of the way to the minimum amount, leaving this model 1” away from enemy models. If a Titanic model or Terrain piece is hit, this model then tests for Deepstrike Mishap. This model may charge the turn it arrives from Reserves.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
