        </rule>
        <rule id="66600941-5e4f-561f-8df9-3d2bda7aeb48" name="Gulp" hidden="false">
          <description>When a Gulp weapon successfully hits on a 6, you may pick the target of the attack. If all Saves fail, swallow the target! The model is Embarked on the Gulp model and may only make Snap Shots on Ranged and Melee attacks. In each of your Command Phases, the model suffers a Mortal Wound. If the Gulp model is slain, all Embarked units Disembark upon its demise.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
